# ===== 安全底线：本地私有内容永不上传 =====
private/
private/**
*.local.md
*.private.md

# ===== 凭据与密钥 =====
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_ed25519
*_token.txt
credentials.*

# ===== 敏感数据文件 =====
*cost*.xlsx
*成本*.xlsx
*进货价*
*password*
*密码*

# ===== 系统/编辑器垃圾 =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.obsidian/workspace*
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
*.swp
*~

# ===== 临时与缓存 =====
tmp/
temp/
.cache/
node_modules/

# ===== 日志（可能含敏感路径/账号） =====
*.log
